OL,3,GNEWSARyan Reynolds and Rob Mac buy
OL,4,Ahistoric Wrexham football pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FWrexham's Hollywood co-owners Ryan
OL,7,FReynolds and Rob Mac have bought the
OL,8,Fpub next door to the football club's
OL,9,FRacecourse home ground to "protect the
OL,10,Ffuture of the club".
OL,12,FWrexham AFC was founded at the
OL,13,Fthen-named Turf Hotel in October 1864
OL,14,Fand is the oldest football club in
OL,15,FWales.
OL,17,FA club statement announcing the
OL,18,Fpurchase from Admiral Taverns said it
OL,19,Fhoped to "help protect the historic
OL,20,Fpub" by "incorporating the club, the
OL,21,FRacecourse Ground and The Turf under a
OL,22,Fsingle ownership".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
